= Review status =

[[Has type::Text]]

The state of an explicit review or verification process, separate from the claim's epistemic standing.

Examples may include:

* <code>Unreviewed</code>
* <code>Needs review</code>
* <code>Reviewed</code>
* <code>Verification pending</code>
* <code>Verified</code>
* <code>Review disputed</code>

When using <code>Verified</code>, the page should make clear what was verified and by what method. Verification is not a synonym for absolute certainty.

See [[BITwiki:Claim validation]].
